    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a zero-gravity space station warped by a catastrophic experiment, you must survive a labyrinth of shifting corridors and hostile anomalies. Scavenge for resources, upgrade your suit, and fight your way through terrifying threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> Encounter a new layout every time you enter a level or restart after death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for Survival:</strong> Search for weapons, ammo, and resources to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Strategically manage your limited inventory to carry only what you need most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Threats:</strong> Face a variety of relentless enemies hunting you throughout the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Suit Modules:</strong> Upgrade your suit with powerful modules to enhance your abilities and suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Story:</strong> Find logs to unveil the station\u2019s dark secrets and the experiment that shattered reality.</p></li></ul>",
